1. "mongosh"-> start mongogodb using shell command on terminal

2. "show dbs"-> show all dbs in our connections

3. "use dbName"-> create new Database/ select exixting database

4. "db.createCollection("User")": create collection in database.

5."show collections"-> show all collection list 


6.insert one data in collection:  

 db.User.insertOne({"Name":"Ram sharma","Mobile":"+91-8798564564","Email":"rs@gmail.com","Account Type":"Admin"})

7.insert many in one query:

db.Customer.insertMany([{"Name":"Rajiv Mina","Mobile":"+91-8798765456","Email":"rm234@gmail.com"},{"Name":"Kiran Kumawat","Mobile":"+91-8798765676","Email":"kk767@gmail.com"}])

8. find records:

db.Customer.find()